3. Files and Code Sections:
   - **`/s/bach/j/under/itshazel/CS370_FA26/rbtree-lab/src/rbtree.c`** (never edited by me — only read/reviewed across multiple turns; edited externally by the user/IDE between my reads)
     - Initial state (turn 1): `rb_insert` was BST-only; fixup was a `TODO` comment; no `rb_rotate_left`/`rb_rotate_right` existed yet.
     - After turn 2 (user applied my drafted rotation helpers + added a fixup loop themselves), I found two bugs on review (turn 3):
